From: Dodaskot <pessdres@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 01:16:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 010/131] Input: add Himax HX83112F zero-flash SPI touchscreen;
 a22x: SPI1 + touch

IC/protocol layers from the Samsung SM-A226B kernel source (Himax
reference driver), ported to 7.x APIs; MediaTek tpd glue replaced by a
plain spi_driver using gpiod and DT interrupts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
